[{:db/id "q-88239/selection/0af276ce011a2a9c436b57df5b9ece6ea438edb69a6182cb9c36cbeb4d1ab5d5" :answer/id #uuid "4f86e2bc-27e3-5863-9dd6-0298bea13623" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\le -1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88239/selection/feaa729589f3ad4094f45abd8a06a204c1dd648cbbc49003db390ac699fcb1c2" :answer/id #uuid "20dd2814-e055-5d8c-9a60-40fcf194662c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x\\le -1$ or $x\\ge 3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88239/selection/6e23a2790da0602be405d3d76403ec69cbe6c9432040424a85d0ad6e56d5f734" :answer/id #uuid "56353a35-da6b-5ac0-8b32-6f2444646c80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1\\le x\\le 3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88239/selection/13c0004b165b449a6b2b540fed692935a9ee264ded801b56bc89875a2e311257" :answer/id #uuid "6e5d9f80-3d24-5bd7-be1e-38559568d10b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge 3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88239/selection/0ba22592083b93ab63237c1a24e6a2e40112c45c0f6102e5e877e94552db2aa2" :answer/id #uuid "1e2ae130-21a6-597f-ae28-5e2f25d5337d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1\\le x\\le 3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88239/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "015969ed-d686-5d7d-b6ff-f5e8e4ef6912" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-88239/selection/feaa729589f3ad4094f45abd8a06a204c1dd648cbbc49003db390ac699fcb1c2" :answer-field/choices ["q-88239/selection/0af276ce011a2a9c436b57df5b9ece6ea438edb69a6182cb9c36cbeb4d1ab5d5" "q-88239/selection/feaa729589f3ad4094f45abd8a06a204c1dd648cbbc49003db390ac699fcb1c2" "q-88239/selection/6e23a2790da0602be405d3d76403ec69cbe6c9432040424a85d0ad6e56d5f734" "q-88239/selection/13c0004b165b449a6b2b540fed692935a9ee264ded801b56bc89875a2e311257" "q-88239/selection/0ba22592083b93ab63237c1a24e6a2e40112c45c0f6102e5e877e94552db2aa2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-88239" :question/id #uuid "f48d4b46-71bc-5848-b1c9-c4123817afbb" :question/math-academy-id "q-88239" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $-2x{e}^{5x}-3{e}^{5x}\\ge -{x}^{2}{e}^{5x}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2x{e}^{5x}-3{e}^{5x} & \\ge -{x}^{2}{e}^{5x} \\\\ {x}^{2}{e}^{5x}-2x{e}^{5x}-3{e}^{5x} & \\ge 0 \\\\ ({x}^{2}-2x-3){e}^{5x} & \\ge 0 \\\\ (x+1)(x-3){e}^{5x} & \\ge 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${e}^{5x}$ and get\n\n$$\n(x+1)(x-3)\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nThis represents an upwards parabola whose roots are at $x=-1$ and $x=3.$ The parabola is above the $x$-axis when $x\\le -1$ or $x\\ge 3.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036850/assets/6aca0f7c055a5f326c2d0d3bc65b6e68a90c8cb496bc1934dbae6093d0d71f96.png)\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x\\le -1$ or $x\\ge 3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-88239/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "479e5736-efe1-5e94-929f-3dcd6d13a733"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-88239"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-88308/selection/09307a132861a8c3e1f394b8f9d88afb4499e3bb763da85e74c158b9b8288a43" :answer/id #uuid "a6bf2577-e0ac-54c6-b1f5-564a25b28161" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>\\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88308/selection/98a139fd97302e1867c766ebf0f4af73d1777a775d01534bd63f02ac2480752e" :answer/id #uuid "839e1e0b-9680-5415-bc0a-1f7ac2aa610c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x<-2\\sqrt{3}$ or $x>2\\sqrt{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88308/selection/0e7a63180411a47d2ee7ef7934d471cd86b3c23b9e40e216e9594f5a780e2f8d" :answer/id #uuid "3c2e0781-c7f4-5cd0-ba3c-b79b196f5b29" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\sqrt{3}<x<2\\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88308/selection/c8c7a6ccd132bb130a67cc2ba6a9b54a2fb16e1e5b56c20d95efd5a8f5bf107c" :answer/id #uuid "14318fb7-a5d4-5926-96af-df57cbadc68b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x<-\\sqrt{3}$ or $x>\\sqrt{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88308/selection/a5fd4ccad86855890c9c5194901ac387812dc84e8dcaa82da7b5a7de069ee892" :answer/id #uuid "09f018ae-44fc-5a62-a39a-9e3fcc9dc3d2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x<-2$ or $x>2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-88308/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "dcdcd42e-47de-59b7-a9c1-4ac020a0c88d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-88308/selection/98a139fd97302e1867c766ebf0f4af73d1777a775d01534bd63f02ac2480752e" :answer-field/choices ["q-88308/selection/09307a132861a8c3e1f394b8f9d88afb4499e3bb763da85e74c158b9b8288a43" "q-88308/selection/98a139fd97302e1867c766ebf0f4af73d1777a775d01534bd63f02ac2480752e" "q-88308/selection/0e7a63180411a47d2ee7ef7934d471cd86b3c23b9e40e216e9594f5a780e2f8d" "q-88308/selection/c8c7a6ccd132bb130a67cc2ba6a9b54a2fb16e1e5b56c20d95efd5a8f5bf107c" "q-88308/selection/a5fd4ccad86855890c9c5194901ac387812dc84e8dcaa82da7b5a7de069ee892"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-88308" :question/id #uuid "99779233-4022-57ea-8b13-fcf906c4aeff" :question/math-academy-id "q-88308" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $-{9}^{2x-4}{x}^{2}<-5\\cdot {9}^{2x-4}-7\\cdot {9}^{2x-4}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{9}^{2x-4}{x}^{2} & <-5\\cdot {9}^{2x-4}-7\\cdot {9}^{2x-4} \\\\ -{9}^{2x-4}{x}^{2}+5\\cdot {9}^{2x-4}+7\\cdot {9}^{2x-4} & <0 \\\\ (-{x}^{2}+5+7){9}^{2x-4} & <0 \\\\ (12-{x}^{2}){9}^{2x-4} & <0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${9}^{2x-4}$ and solve the resulting inequality using familiar techniques:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12-{x}^{2} & <0 \\\\ -{x}^{2} & <-12 \\\\ {x}^{2} & >12 \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}} & >\\sqrt{12} \\\\ |x| & >2\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to the inequality above is $x<-2\\sqrt{3}$ or $x>2\\sqrt{3}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-88308/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "479e5736-efe1-5e94-929f-3dcd6d13a733"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-88308"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-278274/field-1/78a7e48403bfc3aa596ef28683ea3912541da0aaa7377114be10358a6cb850d1" :answer/id #uuid "09d5a8c0-a56f-56c8-adcf-eac9b03c6eb9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-81" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278274/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "03d12289-391b-5f6f-bc69-8de44074ef15" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278274/field-1/78a7e48403bfc3aa596ef28683ea3912541da0aaa7377114be10358a6cb850d1" :answer-field/choices ["q-278274/field-1/78a7e48403bfc3aa596ef28683ea3912541da0aaa7377114be10358a6cb850d1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278274/field-2/f022eff7ecaa4435243255d76a2a932e99db9e71ca2b89b05fafca75800709a0" :answer/id #uuid "3b287992-df56-5a51-885a-4f2bff1850ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\le" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278274/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "3161039d-5a03-5520-b70d-57b1be789e8b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278274/field-2/f022eff7ecaa4435243255d76a2a932e99db9e71ca2b89b05fafca75800709a0" :answer-field/choices ["q-278274/field-2/f022eff7ecaa4435243255d76a2a932e99db9e71ca2b89b05fafca75800709a0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278274/field-3/a5bcf5044d7131cdf0d721e80125a87ad3d00df1e947910bf38c9dd3889981de" :answer/id #uuid "45c1318a-8956-5305-a256-1ede305dd663" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "81" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278274/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "affd910a-0afa-54e7-a0cf-83e222212ee3" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278274/field-3/a5bcf5044d7131cdf0d721e80125a87ad3d00df1e947910bf38c9dd3889981de" :answer-field/choices ["q-278274/field-3/a5bcf5044d7131cdf0d721e80125a87ad3d00df1e947910bf38c9dd3889981de"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278274" :question/id #uuid "068395a5-3ec4-58e6-8f94-368cfc9a666e" :question/math-academy-id "q-278274" :question/problem "Solve the inequality ${x}^{2}\\cdot {9}^{2x-3}\\le {9}^{2x+1}.$\n\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\le x$ \n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}\\cdot {9}^{2x-3} & \\le {9}^{2x+1} \\\\ {x}^{2}\\cdot {9}^{2x-3}-{9}^{2x+1} & \\le 0 \\\\ {x}^{2}\\cdot {9}^{2x-3}-{9}^{4}\\cdot {9}^{2x-3} & \\le 0 \\\\ ({x}^{2}-{9}^{4})\\cdot {9}^{2x-3} & \\le 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${9}^{2x-3}$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{({x}^{2}-{9}^{4})\\cdot {9}^{2x-3}}{{9}^{2x-3}} & \\le \\frac{0}{{9}^{2x-3}} \\\\ {x}^{2}-{9}^{4} & \\le 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can solve this inequality using familiar methods:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-{9}^{4} & \\le 0 \\\\ {x}^{2} & \\le {9}^{4} \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}} & \\le \\sqrt{{9}^{4}} \\\\ |x| & \\le {9}^{2} \\\\ |x| & \\le 81\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to the inequality above is $-81\\le x<81.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-278274/field-1" "q-278274/field-2" "q-278274/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ac76d62e-6bea-515a-af06-e4fae7bc1338"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-278274"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-278282/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "a0ef5fb8-3414-51fd-adf6-750f895d4088" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278282/fi