278282" :question/id #uuid "57bdf8c1-be66-5c66-b4df-025f362289b1" :question/math-academy-id "q-278282" :question/problem "Solve the inequality ${x}^{4}\\cdot {4}^{3x-5}\\ge {4}^{3x-1}.$\n\n$x\\le ${{field-1}}\n$\\,\\text{or}\\,x$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{4}\\cdot {4}^{3x-5} & \\ge {4}^{3x-1} \\\\ {x}^{4}\\cdot {4}^{3x-5}-{4}^{3x-1} & \\ge 0 \\\\ {x}^{4}\\cdot {4}^{3x-5}-{4}^{4}\\cdot {4}^{3x-5} & \\ge 0 \\\\ ({x}^{4}-{4}^{4}){4}^{3x-5} & \\ge 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${4}^{3x-5}$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{({x}^{4}-{4}^{4}){4}^{3x-5}}{{4}^{3x-5}} & \\ge \\frac{0}{{4}^{3x-5}} \\\\ {x}^{4}-{4}^{4} & \\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can solve this inequality using familiar methods:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{4}-{4}^{4} & \\ge 0 \\\\ {x}^{4} & \\ge {4}^{4} \\\\ \\sqrt[4]{{x}^{4}} & \\ge \\sqrt[4]{{4}^{4}} \\\\ |x| & \\ge 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the inequality above is  $x\\le -4$ or $x\\ge 4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-278282/field-1" "q-278282/field-2" "q-278282/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ac76d62e-6bea-515a-af06-e4fae7bc1338"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-278282"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-278284/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "37298271-4e88-56a6-86ea-d728f3b7d46d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278284/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "91866a0d-a6bc-5b4e-bddc-ed9d73a9f383" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278284/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-278284/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708